## 3. Phase A Status: NOT ACCEPTED (Design-Agent Audit)

Defiant hat Phase A Fixups committet (Commits e8eaf9329e, 0812b86008, 9d4d165d49 auf wip/xaverius, Build grün). Fixes:
1. XaveriusExtensionInit no longer static
2. Removed duplicate AddResource call in registry
